    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "any explanation which is based, like Rhumbler’s, on mere mechanical traction, is obviously inadequate, and we shall find ourselves limited to the hypothesis of some polarised and polarising force, such as we deal with, for instance, in the phenomena of magnetism or electricity." ;
